{"id":939298,"title":"04｜越大越牛？Transformer和它的scaling law","content":"傅聪讲解了生成式推荐中Transformer及其Scaling Law。首先，通过对比LSTM，介绍了Transformer的架构与设计理念，强调其并行训练能力、无限记忆机制及注意力机制。接着回顾了三种重要的Transformer结构：BERT（仅编码器）、T5（编码-解码器）和GPT（仅解码器），分析了各自的优劣。然后讨论了Tokenizer的重要性，指出其在信息压缩中的关键作用，并介绍了BPE和Unigram两种主流分词方法。最后探讨了Scaling Law的概念，包括模型参数、数据量和算力对模型性能的影响，以及生成式推荐系统面临的挑战，如大规模词表压缩、模型设计优化、高质量数据整合及成本效益平衡。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":405090,"user_name":"良多","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3663161,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"CF8984D62800AF","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/37/e5/39/6b99d099.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769930695,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":147628,"content":"感谢指正，确实是写反了，应该是空间换时间","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":4424762,"ctime":1770641955,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":405090,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101108201,"comment_content":"请问视频 15min 的 PPT 里写的 Transformer 时间换空间是不是写反了，应该是空间换时间？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4424762,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/43/84/3a/3d745603.jpg","nickname":"傅聪Cong","note":"","ucode":"83729C2BAD5684","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":678218,"discussion_content":"感谢指正，确实是写反了，应该是空间换时间","content_length":60,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1770641955,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}